Package: otexts
Title: Shared Setup for OTexts Books
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Rob J", "Hyndman", , "Rob.Hyndman@monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2140-5352"))
Description: Shared R setup for the OTexts books written with Quarto: the
    'ggplot2' theme, colour palette and printing options used in the books,
    maths in plot labels set in the same fonts as 'KaTeX' maths in the text,
    and a simple cache for long computations. Companion to the 'otexts'
    Quarto format extension.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/OTexts/otexts, https://otexts.github.io/otexts/
BugReports: https://github.com/OTexts/otexts/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0),
    here,
    latex2exp,
    rlang,
    systemfonts (>= 1.0.0)
Suggests:
    conflicted,
    ggraph,
    ggrepel,
    ragg,
